@startuml
' Exactly 8 business transitions: SRS section 3.6, FR-23/24, BR-08
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam ArrowColor #536C83
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EDF5FB
skinparam StateBorderColor #536C83
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF4D9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B99655
title BrewLite A2 — Order state machine (8 valid transitions)

state PENDING
state PAID
state PAYMENT_FAILED #FCE8E5
state PREPARING
state READY
state COMPLETED #DFF1E5
state CANCELLED #EAEAEA

[*] --> PENDING : POST /orders creates order
PENDING --> PAID : successful payment
PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED : payment declined
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Customer cancellation [FR-25 Could]
PAYMENT_FAILED --> PENDING : retry payment (same Order)
PAYMENT_FAILED --> CANCELLED : Customer cancellation [FR-25 Could]
PAID --> PREPARING : Barista
PREPARING --> READY : Barista
READY --> COMPLETED : Barista
COMPLETED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  POST /orders reserves stock atomically.
  Failure does not release reserved stock.
end note
note right of PAID
  PAID -> CANCELLED is NOT allowed in A2.
  FR-26 is Won't; reject with
  409 INVALID_ORDER_TRANSITION.
end note
note bottom of CANCELLED
  FR-25 is Could: both cancel edges exist in
  model but API/UI not required for minimum.
  If implemented, release stock atomically.
end note
@enduml
